SUMMARY:[Complex Systems & Network Science][Graphs & Graph Learning] Comple
 Net 2027 - Extended abstract submission deadline (independent route)
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: International Conference on Complex Networks\
 nWebsite: https://complenet.github.io/\nSource URL: https://complenet.git
 hub.io/cfp.html\nLocation: Rochester\, New York\, USA\nTopics: Complex Sy
 stems & Network Science\, Graphs & Graph Learning\, Nonlinear Dynamics & 
 Chaos\, Computational Neuroscience\nSize: M\nSubmission type: Full/short 
 papers + extended abstracts\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 20
 26-10-08\nNotes: University of Rochester host. Reviewed long and short pa
 pers appear in Springer Complexity\; the abstract-only route does not pro
 duce a proceedings paper. All three routes share the AoE deadline\, with 
 no mandatory abstract-registration gate. Size is an editorial estimate.\n
 Scope: Network science across mathematical\, biological\, technological a
 nd social systems\, with characteristic interests in network dynamics\, c
 ommunity structure\, temporal and multilayer networks\, network neuroscie
 nce and learning on networks. Long and short reviewed papers are distinct
  from abstract-only presentations.\nAdditional topics: Time Series & Sequ
 ential Data\, Data Mining & Data Science\, Machine Learning\nScope source
 s (2027): https://complenet.github.io/cfp.html\nScope last checked: 2026-
